  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att tillhandah&#xe5;lla ett tekniskt utrymme f&#xf6;r guatemalanska civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer specialiserade p&#xe5; m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter, s&#xe4;kerhet och r&#xe4;ttvisa, f&#xf6;r alliansbyggande och opinionsbildningsinsatser fokuserade p&#xe5; fr&#xe4;mjandet av en demokratisk agenda och insatser f&#xf6;r att hindra en ytterligare tillbakag&#xe5;ng f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i landet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution aims to provide a technical space for Guatemalan Civil Society Organizations specialized on human rights, security and justice, for articulation and advocacy efforts focused on the  promotion of a democratic agenda and the containment of the regressive trends on the country.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This short term contribution is aimed to provide a technical space for Guatemalan civil society organizations specialized on human rights, security and justice, for articulation and advocacy efforts focused on the  promotion of a democratic agenda.</narrative>
